# Gateway & adapters

- Core logic talks to **interfaces only** (`LlmGateway`, `AgentCore`). Never import a vendor SDK
  (`@anthropic-ai/*`, AWS Bedrock clients, OpenAI, etc.) outside `gateway/adapters/` or
  `agent/adapters/`.
- One adapter = one provider. Shared retry/backoff/circuit-breaker lives in the gateway, not in
  each adapter.
- Streaming is first-class. Per-stage timings (TTFT, total, cache hit/miss) go through the structured
  logger — never bare `console.log`.
- Model IDs, endpoints, timeouts, and prompts are config/contracts — not string literals in logic.
- Before relying on SDK option names or Bedrock inference-profile IDs, confirm against live docs /
  `aws bedrock list-inference-profiles`. Unverifiable → `[VERIFY]` + BUILD_LOG blocker.
